 337  *==============================================================================
 338  *  2.2 Variables - Benchmark
 339  *==============================================================================
 340  *  Benchmark values of variables are parameters. Their acronyms are the
 341  *  corresponding variable names,followed by the letter "O".
 342   
 343  *==============================================================================
 344  *   2.2.1 Volume variables
 345  *==============================================================================
 346   CABXO(z)        Current account balance of region z in terms of the international currency (pseudo-volume variable)
 347   CO(i,z)         Consumption of commodity i by households in region z
 348   CGO(i,z)        Public consumption of commodity i in region z
 349   CIO(j,z)        Total intermediate consumption of industry j in region z
 350   CEO(j,z)        Total energy intermediate consumption of industry j in region z
 351   CMINO(i,z)      Minimum consumption of commodity i by households in region z
 352   CTH_REALO(z)    Real household consumption in region z
 353   DDO(i,z)        Domestic demand for commodity i produced locally in region z
 354   DIO(i,j,z)      Intermediate consumption of commodity i by industry j in region z
 355   DEO(ene,j,z)    Intermediate energy consumption of commodity i by industry j in region z
 356   DITO(i,z)       Total intermediate demand of commodity i in region z
 357   DSO(j,i,z)      Supply of commodity i by sector j to the domestic market
 358   DSO_I(i,z)      Supply of commodity i to the domestic market of region z
 359   DSO_J(j,z)      Supply of activity j to the domestic market of region z
 360   EXO(i,z,zj)     Quantity of product i exported by country z to country zj
 361   EXTO(i,z)       Supply of composite commodity i by region z to the export market
 362   EXTTO(j,i,z)    Supply of activity j to the export market i of region z
 363   G_REALO(z)      Current real government expenditures on goods and services in region z
 364   GDP_BP_REALO(z) Real GDP at basic prices
 365   GDP_MP_REALO(z) Real GDP at market prices
 366   GDP_BP_W_REALO  Real GDP at basic prices
 367   IMO(i,zj,z)     Quantity of product i imported by country z from country zj
 368   IMTO(i,z)       Quantity demanded of composite imports of commodity i by region z
 369   INVO(i,z)       Final demand of commodity i for investment purposes (GFCF) in region z
 370   IT_REALO(z)     Real gross fixed capital formation
 371   KDO(k,j,z)      Demand for type k capital by industry j in region z
 372   KDCO(j,z)       Demand for composite capital by industry j in region z
 373   KSO(k,z)        Supply of type k capital in region z
 374   KSTO(z)         Total supply of capital in region z
 375   LDO(l,j,z)      Demand for type l labor by industry j in region z
 376   LDCO(j,z)       Demand for composite labor by industry j in region z
 377   LSO(l,z)        Supply of type l labor in region z
 378   MRGNO(i,z)      Domestic production of commodity i in region z exported as international margin services
 379   POPO(z)         Population in 2019
 380   QO(i,z)         Quantity demanded of composite commodity i in region z
 381   VAO(j,z)        Value added of industry j in region z
 382   KLEO(j,z)       KLE of industry j in region z
 383   XSO_I(i,z)      Commoidty i total production
 384   XSO(j,i,z)      Total output of industry j in region z
 385   XSTO(j,z)       Total output of industry j
 386   POWERQO(z)      Total power output in region z
 387   
 388  *==============================================================================
 389  *   2.2.2 Price variables
 390  *==============================================================================
 391   eO(z)           Exchange rate (price of international currency in terms of region z local currency)
 392   PO(i,z)         Basic price of commodity i in region z
 393   PO2(j,i,z)      Basic price of industry js production of commodity i
 394   PO3(i,j,z)
 395   PO4(i,j,z)
 396   PPOWERO(z)
 397   PIO(i,z)
 398   PTO(j,z)        Basic price of industry js output
 399   PCO(i,z)        Purchaser price of composite commodity i (including all taxes and margins) in region z
 400   PCIO(j,z)       Intermediate consumption price index of industry j in region z
 401   PCEO(j,z)       Intermediate energy consumption price index of industry j in region z
 402   PDO(i,z)        Price of local product i sold on region z domestic market (including all taxes)
 403   PEO(i,z,zj)     Price received for commodity i exported to region zj by region z (excluding export taxes)
 404   PETO(i,z)       Border price of composite commodity i exported by region z
 405   PIXCONO(z)      Consumer price index in region z
 406   PIXGDPO(z)      GDP deflator in region z
 407   PIXGDP_WO       World GDP deflator
 408   PIXGVTO(z)      Public expenditures price index in region z
 409   PIXINVO(z)      Investment price index in region z
 410   PKO(z)          Price of new capital in region z
 411   PLO(i,z)        Price of local product i (excluding all taxes on products) in region z
 412   PMO(i,zj,z)     Price of commodity i imported by region z from region zj (including all taxes duties and margins)
 413   PMTO(i,z)       Price of composite commodity i imported by region z (including all taxes duties and margins)
 414   PPO(j,z)        Unit cost of industry j in region z including taxes directly related to the use of capital and labor but excluding other taxes on production
 415   PVAO(j,Z)       Price of industry j value added in region z (including taxes on production directly related to the use of capital and labor)
 416   PKLEO(j,z)      Price of industry j KLE in region z
 417   PWMO(i,zj,z)    World price of commodity i imported from country zj by region z (expressed in international currency)
 418   PWMGO(i)        World price of margin i (expressed in international currency)
 419   PWXO(i,z,zj)    World price of commodity i exported to country zj by region z (expressed in international currency)
 420   RO(k,j,z)       Rental rate of type k capital in industry j of region z
 421   RCO(j,z)        Rental rate of industry j composite capital in region z
 422   RKO(k,z)        Rental rate of type k capital in region z
 423   RTIO(k,j,z)     Rental rate paid by industry j for type k capital in region z including capital taxes
 424   WO(l,z)         Wage rate of type l labor in region z
 425   WCO(j,z)        Wage rate of industry j composite labor in region z
 426   WTIO(l,j,z)     Wage rate paid z by industry j for type l labor in region including payroll taxes
