 458   TIXO(i,z,zj)    Government revenue from export taxes on commodity i exported by region z to region zj
 459   TIXTO(z)        Total government revenue from export taxes in region z
 460   TPRCTSO(z)      Total government revenue from taxes on products and imports in region z
 461   TPRODNO(z)      Total government revenue from other taxes on production in region z
 462   YDHO(z)         Household disposable income in region z
 463   YGO(z)          Total government income in region z
 464   YHO(z)          Household total income in region z
