 487  *==============================================================================
 488  * 3 Data
 489  *==============================================================================
 490  *  3.1 Data input from GTAP8.1
 491  *==============================================================================
 492  *   3.1.1 Reading data aggregated with DATA_AGG-2007.gms
 493  *==============================================================================
 494  *  The PEP w-1 model uses aggregated data from GTAP8.1. The following file
 495  *  includes data for some variables and substitution elasticities.
GDXIN   C:\Users\kimc0\GUIDE_GLOBAL_CGE\1.Static_CGE\Input_w-1\DATA_AGG-2019_GTAP11_240214.gdx
